Package: strling
Type: Package
Title: Thin R Adapter for the Canonical STRling Compiler
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "STRling", family = "Project", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Projects canonical request and result data through a caller-selected
    strling.c-abi version 1 library. The package owns host projection and native
    lifecycle only; it does not implement STRling semantics.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0), R (< 5.0.0)
Imports: jsonlite (>= 1.8.8)
Suggests: testthat
URL: https://github.com/strling-lang/strling
BugReports: https://github.com/strling-lang/strling/issues
